  "headline": "Helicopter Involved In Firefighting Operations Crashes In Barito",
  "seoTitle": "Helicopter Crash During Firefighting In Barito River",
  "metaDescription": "A helicopter conducting water bombing operations crashed into the Barito River, resulting in one fatality and two survivors, according to officials.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "A Super Puma H-225 helicopter crashed into the Barito River in South Kalimantan while performing water bombing operations for forest fire control.",
    "Search and rescue efforts resulted in the recovery of one deceased crew member, identified as an Indonesian citizen.",
    "Two foreign national pilots survived the incident, and officials confirmed that the crash will not disrupt ongoing fire suppression activities."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The incident involved a chartered Super Puma H-225 helicopter registered as VH-HGM that was contracted by the National Disaster Management Agency (BNPB) for forest and land fire suppression efforts. The aircraft went down in the Barito River near Tabatan Village, Kuripan District, Barito Kuala Regency, South Kalimantan. Following the crash, a joint rescue team was deployed to locate the crew. While two foreign pilots were confirmed as survivors, the search operation ended with the discovery of a deceased Indonesian crew member. Despite the accident, BNPB officials have stated that regional efforts to extinguish forest and land fires will continue as planned without major interruptions. Authorities are currently managing the aftermath of the crash and confirming details regarding the circumstances surrounding the flight operation.",
  "whyItIsViral": "The event has generated high public search interest and rapid media coverage due to the involvement of disaster management aircraft and an active search-and-rescue operation.",
